{"about_the_game":"<strong>Attention: This game is for VR only.</strong><br><br>Primitier is a highly flexible VR sandbox game, where you can create tools and machinery by freely cutting and connecting objects in a vast world based on physics simulation.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >True Craft System</h2>By striking a tree with a stone, the tree is cut at the point of impact. Attach a stone to the end of a cut piece of wood of a suitable length, and you have a stone axe. In this way, you can craft various tools with a realistic sense of craftsmanship, not only with wood and stone but also with almost all objects found within the game.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/extras/3726f808988ba092eade6134c54e5e14.poster.avif?t=1747840270\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/extras/3726f808988ba092eade6134c54e5e14.webm?t=1747840270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/extras/3726f808988ba092eade6134c54e5e14.mp4?t=1747840270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expansive World</h2>You can seamlessly traverse a vast, procedurally generated world. As you explore, you may encounter enemies\u2014so be prepared to create weapons to defend yourself.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/extras/977ef1692631917a5dd57d37a08b8f5e.poster.avif?t=1747840270\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/extras/977ef1692631917a5dd57d37a08b8f5e.webm?t=1747840270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/extras/977ef1692631917a5dd57d37a08b8f5e.mp4?t=1747840270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Advanced Physics Simulation</h2>Including crafted tools, all objects interact through physics simulation. For example, the ease of swinging and destructive power of a stone axe depends on the handle's length and the stone's weight. You can also create machines like carts and airplanes that operate physically.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/extras/17032a8c4329ad3943e008154963b814.poster.avif?t=1747840270\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/extras/17032a8c4329ad3943e008154963b814.webm?t=1747840270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/extras/17032a8c4329ad3943e008154963b814.mp4?t=1747840270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Simulations of air resistance, lift, and buoyancy are also included.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/extras/bba96f6b11fddc7ebe7592d92aa7dbe2.poster.avif?t=1747840270\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/extras/bba96f6b11fddc7ebe7592d92aa7dbe2.webm?t=1747840270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/extras/bba96f6b11fddc7ebe7592d92aa7dbe2.mp4?t=1747840270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Avatar Importing</h2>You can change your avatar by loading VRM format files (not all VRM files are supported). The avatar can be hidden if desired.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Posting and Broadcasting Gameplay Videos</h2>We allow the posting and broadcasting of gameplay videos within our guidelines. Please refer to the official website's guidelines for more details.<br>Note that you can output a third-person perspective video on your PC screen using the in-game camera.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1745170?t=1747840270","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1745170?t=1747840270","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/71ba338957aea56112e7cfffb6cb35c75051a285/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747840270","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/71ba338957aea56112e7cfffb6cb35c75051a285/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747840270","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":1829750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<strong>Attention: This game is for VR only.</strong><br><br>Primitier is a highly flexible VR sandbox game, where you can create tools and machinery by freely cutting and connecting objects in a vast world based on physics simulation.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >True Craft System</h2>By striking a tree with a stone, the tree is cut at the point of impact. Attach a stone to the end of a cut piece of wood of a suitable length, and you have a stone axe. In this way, you can craft various tools with a realistic sense of craftsmanship, not only with wood and stone but also with almost all objects found within the game.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/extras/3726f808988ba092eade6134c54e5e14.poster.avif?t=1747840270\"