p9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/extras/17032a8c4329ad3943e008154963b814.mp4?t=1747840270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Simulations of air resistance, lift, and buoyancy are also included.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/extras/bba96f6b11fddc7ebe7592d92aa7dbe2.poster.avif?t=1747840270\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/extras/bba96f6b11fddc7ebe7592d92aa7dbe2.webm?t=1747840270\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/extras/bba96f6b11fddc7ebe7592d92aa7dbe2.mp4?t=1747840270\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Avatar Importing</h2>You can change your avatar by loading VRM format files (not all VRM files are supported). The avatar can be hidden if desired.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Posting and Broadcasting Gameplay Videos</h2>We allow the posting and broadcasting of gameplay videos within our guidelines. Please refer to the official website's guidelines for more details.<br>Note that you can output a third-person perspective video on your PC screen using the in-game camera.","developers":["Ota Mato"],"dlc":[2091600],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745170/5e99dae272c200798cdc677412ad15f6b52cecfe/header.jpg?t=1747840270","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul